      <activity id="ab1cc6d9-3a30-593e-bbbc-0a8eb0df8c56" activityNameId="ea89006c-9662-5cc6-8252-8cdb37e97647" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dismantling, LCD screen, mechanically, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dismantling, LCD screen, mechanically, at plant
manual dismantling plus subsequent shredding/separation procedure, based on common transfer coefficients for both steps. Data from literature and from own experiences in Switzerland.;
UUID: 00e5afb5-e3bb-44c1-9c29-265a0201f4e0
This dataset represents the mechanical treatment of a WEEE devices in Switzerland. Two process steps are included: manual depollution and the mechanical treatment (shredder) of the remaining part.
Location: European data, used as average for global situation
Technology: 4-step-procedure (shredder - separation - shredder - separation) as used currently often in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and own experiences 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_00e5afb5-e3bb-44c1-9c29-265a0201f4e0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
